## Build 1: 
SAM skeleton for CloudFormation
/health is route/path. standard health check
api address / path 

- template.yaml = IaC
- Transform = expands SAM shorthand into full CludFormation
- Globals = shared settings for every function - x-ray
- HttpApi = API
- HealthFunction = /health code
 - CodeUri = which folder, Handler app.handler = file app.py